- Melee
- Dueling Vibro-Staff (Staff)
-- Saber Defense (2)
-- No Blaster Defense/Deflect
-- Cripples on hit
-- BP Free Jumps
-- 5 Hit Combo
-- Saber Throw (3) ^3[CS1]

^8Powers:
- Protect (1)
- Lightning (2) ^3[CS4]
- Drain (2) ^3[CS3]
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Stasis (3)
- Jump (1)
- Grip (2)

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (1)
- Knockdown Roll
- Combat Suit (Env Protection 1)
- Anti MT (1)
- Blast Armor
- Armor Regen (1)
- Rally
- Stamina (3)
- Beskar (1)
- Force Block (1)
- Force Focus (2)
- 25% Less Knockback Taken

^3Abilities:
- Sith Personal Shield ^3[CS3]"
